            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Gà Núi 1",
            "review_text": "hotrannhatnga\n14 contributions\n0\nMore then awesome.\nFeb 2024 • Family\nIt is currently 13:36 in the middle of a sunny afternoon, but the chicken rice restaurant is very cool and has a parking space that won't be exposed to the sun. The food plate is meticulously and beautifully decorated. The chicken is firm and delicious. Location is clean. My son and I traveled more than 11km to get to the restaurant because there is my son's favorite dish: delicious rotisserie chicken and shredded chicken rice is also great. High quality but very affordable price. 100 score.\nRead more\nWritten February 3, 2024",
