            "review_text": "Nguyệt H\n3 contributions\n2\nDelicious chicken rice restaurant in Nha Trang\nJan 2024 • Family\nA must-try chicken restaurant when traveling to Nha Trang. The restaurant is near the sea, the atmosphere is very cool, and the space is spacious. There is car parking. My family loves having lunch here\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten January 9, 2024\nCơm Gà Núi 1\nQuán rất vui khi biết chị thích món ăn ở đây! Cảm ơn chị đã dành thời gian chia sẻ. Mong được gặp lại chị và gia đình ở lần du lịch tiếp theo ạ\nWritten January 11, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
